            ✅ Firebase: ${firebase.length}
          </div>
          <div style="padding:8px 16px;background:#F57C00;color:white;border-radius:0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;">
            🌐 External (working): ${externalOk.length}
          </div>
          <div style="padding:8px 16px;background:var(--red);color:white;border-radius:0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;">
