          </div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--gray-400);margin-bottom:12px;">These external URLs work now but may expire. Cache them to Firebase Storage to keep them permanently.</div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px;">
